,11:IGT-2.tally,627:part igt_2
  tally 2
  law
  note "IGT-2 · When the tax arises, and the base: for a gift, the contract's day, or without one the day it is performed (.1); the base is the market value that day less debts taken over; fund units at the price of the last valuation day on or before it (.2); rounded to whole dukats (.3, GEN-5 .1)."

source igt_2 "Inheritance and Gift Tax Act, IGT-2 When the tax arises, and the base (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version igt2_v1
  cite igt_2
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
  note "IGT-2 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-09-01; governs acquisitions from 2018-01-01."
,11:IGT-3.tally,2930:part igt_3
  tally 2
  law
  note "IGT-3 · Adding up, the free amount and the scale: what was acquired from the same person in the 5 years before the last acquisition is added to it, the free amount deducted once and the tax already paid deducted (.1); the free amount of the acquirer's group in force on the day the last acquisition's tax arises (.2); the group's scale on the amount above it (.3); rounded (.4)."

source igt_3 "Inheritance and Gift Tax Act, IGT-3 Adding up, the free amount and the scale (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

index igt_group = [group_1, group_2, group_3]
  v igt3_v1
  note "the acquirer's groups of IGT-1 .2"

