,11:GEN-5.tally,850:part gen_5
  tally 2
  law
  note "GEN-5 · Rounding. PIT, IGT and TT bases, taxes and advances to whole dukats, under 50 orts down, from 50 up (.1: round(x, 1, half-up)); VAT on an invoice to the ort half up, VAT due or carried in a return to whole dukats as .1 (.2); contributions, benefits, refunds and fees to the ort half up (.3); a rule's own rounding replaces these (.4); nothing else is rounded (.5)."
  note "No figure: the rounding units 1 and 0.01 are literals the literal rule allows (L §7.1); the households' defs call round at the step .5 names."

source gen_5 "General Provisions Act, GEN-5 Rounding (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version gen5_v1
  cite gen_5
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-06-01
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "GEN-5 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-06-01; governs every amount this law computes."
,11:GEN-6.tally,845:part gen_6
  tally 2
  law
  note "GEN-6 · Figures set by notice. Holds the Official Gazette as a source: every gazette figure is a row in its own version, known on the notice's publication day and governing the notice's in-force span (GEN-6 .1); a day no notice covers has no row, so what the law computes from it is a hole (GEN-6 .2, gap rule L §4.6)."
  note "Figures and tables only: the households' own defs apply them and point at these versions with v."

source gazette "Official Gazette of Lenia, notices of figures (tmp/cases/law/gazette.csv)"

source gen_6 "General Provisions Act, GEN-6 Figures set by notice (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version gen6_v1
  cite gen_6
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-06-01
  note "GEN-6 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-06-01; governs every figure the law leaves to a notice."
,11:IGT-1.tally,696:part igt_1
  tally 2
  law
  note "IGT-1 · What is taxed: what a person acquires by inheritance or by gift, the person or the asset being in Lenia (.1); the acquirer's groups I, II and III (.2), held as the index igt_group of IGT-3."
  note "No figure. A sum an insurer pays to a named beneficiary is not acquired by inheritance, so it is outside .1 (and exempt from PIT, PIT-14)."

source igt_1 "Inheritance and Gift Tax Act, IGT-1 What is taxed, and the groups (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version igt1_v1
  cite igt_1
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "IGT-1 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-09-01; governs acquisitions from 2018-01-01."
,11:IGT-2.tally,627:part igt_2
  tally 2
  law
  note "IGT-2 · When the tax arises, and the base: for a gift, the contract's day, or without one the day it is performed (.1); the base is the market value that day less debts taken over; fund units at the price of the last valuation day on or before it (.2); rounded to whole dukats (.3, GEN-5 .1)."

source igt_2 "Inheritance and Gift Tax Act, IGT-2 When the tax arises, and the base (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version igt2_v1
  cite igt_2
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
  note "IGT-2 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-09-01; governs acquisitions from 2018-01-01."
,11:IGT-3.tally,2930:part igt_3
  tally 2
  law
  note "IGT-3 · Adding up, the free amount and the scale: what was acquired from the same person in the 5 years before the last acquisition is added to it, the free amount deducted once and the tax already paid deducted (.1); the free amount of the acquirer's group in force on the day the last acquisition's tax arises (.2); the group's scale on the amount above it (.3); rounded (.4)."

source igt_3 "Inheritance and Gift Tax Act, IGT-3 Adding up, the free amount and the scale (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

index igt_group = [group_1, group_2, group_3]
  v igt3_v1
  note "the acquirer's groups of IGT-1 .2"

input igt3_years: int question "Over how many years before the last acquisition are acquisitions added up (IGT-3 .1)?"

input igt_free[g in igt_group]: money DUK question "What is this group's free amount on the day the tax arises (IGT-3 .2)?"

band igt3_scale[g in igt_group](x: num DUK): num DUK
  note "the tax on the amount above the free amount, per group (IGT-3 .3)"

version igt3_v1
  cite igt_3
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
