  assumed: the extra is a guess (extra)
  pinned: base[k] = base[k] + extra for k in ks
  cut 2026-10-25
a_def (k = k2): 420.00 PLN
  assumed: the extra is a guess (extra)
  pinned: base[k] = base[k] + extra for k in ks
  cut 2026-10-25
a_def (k = k3): 620.00 PLN
  assumed: the extra is a guess (extra)
